mes.com\",\"player.edit.leave.description\":\"Your changes will not be saved if you exit now\",\"player.enterYourDiscordId\":\"Enter Your Discord ID\",\"player.error.invalidShard.description\":\"We noticed that you're trying to register for a Compete Card from the {shard} shard, which is not allowed. Please create an account on EUW to compete.\",\"player.error.invalidShard.title\":\"Invalid Shard\",\"player.exPengu\":\"Ex: Pengu\",\"player.exPengudiscord\":\"Ex: PenguDiscord\",\"player.gameName\":\"Game Name\",\"player.invalidCharacters.error\":\"Tournament Display Name can only contain latin letters, numbers, spaces, and underscores.\",\"player.leave.description\":\"Are you sure you want to leave? You can always register for your Compete Card later if you choose.\",\"player.lengthRequired.error\":\"Tournament Display Name must be between {minDisplayNameLength} and {maxDisplayNameLength} characters.\",\"player.name.description\":\"This is how you will show up to other players in-game and on broadcast/streams during tournaments. You will receive tournament credentials which include the name and password on your Compete Card once they have been approved and issued. Please note that Tournament Realm Display Names are subject to approval and availability.\",\"player.oopsSomethingsWrong\":\"Oops! Something's wrong\",\"player.profile.action.edit\":\"Edit profile\",\"player.profile.completed.description\":\"Your competitor profile is complete.\",\"player.profile.completion.progress\":\"Step {step} of {total}\",\"player.profile.create.title\":\"Create competitor profile\",\"player.profile.discord.placeholder\":\"Ex: Tactigu#7777\",\"player.profile.name.description\":\"Depending on availability, you may be asked to update your name at a later time.\",\"player.profile.name.label\":\"Display name\",\"player.profile.name.placeholder\":\"Name\",\"player.profile.name.preferred.label\":\"Preferred display name\",\"player.profile.name.title\":\"Request a display name\",\"player.pro