ion. Your email will be used to validate your Riot Games account, including validation of in-game behavior, delivery of ticketing access codes, and sending communications about the Worlds 2026 event. To ensure only eligible accounts can purchase tickets, Riot will share your email address, if eligible, with our third party ticketing partners (Ticketmaster and/or Tixr). Your account information may also be stored and used for other Riot Games events ticketing opportunities. For more details on how Riot Games processes your personal information, please refer to our\",\"tickets.registration.note.body\":\"Please note: Your selection is not a guarantee of tickets. You may be selected for alternate dates.\",\"tickets.requirements.account\":\"Riot account must have been created before {date}\",\"tickets.requirements.title\":\"Ticket Eligibility Requirements\",\"tickets.saleLive\":\"Tickets sales will go live on {date}.\",\"tickets.tbd.description\":\"Please check back on {date} for more details on VCT Champions 2025 ticket eligibility.\",\"tickets.tbd.title\":\"COMING SOON\",\"tickets.ticketmasterEmailMustMatch\":\"TICKETMASTER: EMAIL MUST MATCH\",\"tickets.whyIsThisHere\":\"Why is this here?\",\"tickets.youreAlmostThere\":\"You’re almost there!\",\"tier.one\":\"Tier 1\",\"time\":\"Time\",\"time.day.abbr\":\"d\",\"time.day.label\":\"{count, plural, =1{Day} =#{Days}}\",\"time.duration.segment\":\"{value} {unit}\",\"time.event\":\"Time\",\"time.hour.abbr\":\"hr\",\"time.hour.label\":\"{count, plural, =1{Hour} =#{Hours}}\",\"time.hourAbbr\":\"Hr\",\"time.hoursAbbr\":\"Hrs\",\"time.minute.abbr\":\"min\",\"time.minute.label\":\"{count, plural, =1{Minute} =#{Minutes}}\",\"time.minuteAbbr\":\"Min\",\"time.minutesAbbr\":\"Mins\",\"time.second.abbr\":\"sec\",\"time.second.label\":\"{count, plural, =1{Second} =#{Seconds}}\",\"time.secondAbbr\":\"Sec\",\"time.secondsAbbr\":\"Secs\",\"timeIsRequired\":\"Time is required\",\"title\":\"Overview\",\"tomorrow\":\"Tomorrow\",\"total\":\"To